The reference tables in reference/ are compiled from third-party sources that
are named row by row in each file (the UK BNF, WHO ATC/DDD, FDA and EMA product
information, and the publications cited in the manuscript). They are reproduced
here as a dated research reference; the rights in the underlying sources remain
with their publishers.

Nothing in this repository is a prescribing tool or clinical decision aid.
